        "reason": "The evidence's Corpora section states the model is trained on parallel modernization corpora pairing historical originals with modern versions: the Dutch Bible (1637 original paired with the 1888 version), and El Quijote (17th-century Spanish with its 21st-century version); El Conde Lucanor was used only as a test because of its small size, with systems built for El Quijote applied instead. The NMT section additionally notes parameters are estimated on large parallel corpora. Thus the training data are parallel historical–modern corpora."
